    "Olaylar uygulaman\u0131n i\u00e7inde kal\u0131r; istersen ayn\u0131 uyar\u0131y\u0131 telefonunun uyar\u0131 merkezine veya Telegram'a da g\u00f6nder. Hi\u00e7biri zorunlu de\u011fil.": "Vi\u00f0bur\u00f0ir dvelja \u00ed appinu; ef \u00fe\u00fa vilt, sendu sama vi\u00f0v\u00f6run \u00e1 tilkynningami\u00f0st\u00f6\u00f0 s\u00edma \u00fe\u00edns e\u00f0a \u00e1 Telegram. Ekkert af \u00feessu er krafist.", // EN: Events stay inside the app; if you want, send the same alert to your phone's notification centre or to Telegram. None of these is required.
    "Konu ad\u0131 yaz, hesap gerekmez": "Sl\u00e1\u00f0u inn nafni\u00f0 \u00e1 efni \u2014 ekki \u00fearf reikning", // EN: Enter a topic name — no account needed
    "Konu (topic)": "Efni", // EN: Topic
    "Bildirimler ntfy.sh \u00fczerinde bu konuya g\u00f6nderilir; konu ad\u0131n\u0131 sadece sen biliyorsan bildirimi sadece sen al\u0131rs\u0131n.": "Tilkynningar eru birtar \u00e1 \u00feessu efni \u00e1 ntfy.sh; ef a\u00f0eins \u00fe\u00fa \u00feekkir nafni\u00f0 \u00e1 efninu, \u00fe\u00e1 f\u00e6r a\u00f0eins \u00fe\u00fa \u00fe\u00e6r.", // EN: Notifications are published to this topic on ntfy.sh; if only you know the topic name, only you receive them.
    "E-posta": "Netfang", // EN: Email
    "Uyar\u0131lar hesab\u0131n\u0131n e-posta adresine gider": "Vi\u00f0varanir eru sendar \u00e1 netfang reiknings \u00fe\u00edns", // EN: Alerts are sent to your account's email address
    "Bulut oturumu a\u00e7\u0131kken kendi adresine g\u00f6nderilir; saklanacak anahtar yok.": "Sendar \u00e1 eigi\u00f0 netfang me\u00f0an innskr\u00e1\u00f0ur; engar leyningar eru vista\u00f0ar \u00ed appinu.", // EN: Sent to your own address while signed in; no secrets are stored in the app.
    "G\u00f6nderilecek adres": "M\u00f3ttakandi", // EN: Recipient
    "Cihazlar Aras\u0131 Bildirim": "Tilkynningar \u00e1 m\u00f6rgum t\u00e6kjum", // EN: Cross-device Notifications
    "Aile \u00fcyesinin uyar\u0131s\u0131, o ki\u015finin uygulamas\u0131 kapal\u0131yken de bildirim merkezine d\u00fc\u015fer": "Vi\u00f0v\u00f6run fr\u00e1 fj\u00f6lskyldume\u00f0lim kemur \u00ed tilkynningami\u00f0st\u00f6\u00f0ina jafnvel \u00feegar forriti\u00f0 er loka\u00f0", // EN: A family member's alert arrives in the notification centre even when the app is closed
    "Di\u011fer \u00fcyelerin ve kendi di\u011fer cihazlar\u0131n\u0131n bildirim merkezine gider; al\u0131c\u0131 bu kanal\u0131 kendi cihaz\u0131nda a\u00e7m\u0131\u015f olmal\u0131.": "Fer til tilkynningami\u00f0st\u00f6\u00f0var annarra me\u00f0lima og annarra t\u00e6kja \u00feinna; m\u00f3ttakandinn ver\u00f0ur a\u00f0 hafa \u00feetta r\u00e1s virkja\u00f0 \u00e1 s\u00ednum t\u00e6ki.", // EN: Goes to other members' and your other devices' notification centres; the recipient must have this channel enabled on their device.
    "Kendi sunucuna JSON POST \u2014 geli\u015fmi\u015f": "JSON POST \u00e1 \u00feinn eigin net\u00fej\u00f3n \u2014 h\u00e1\u00fer\u00f3a\u00f0", // EN: JSON POST to your own server — advanced
