    "\u00d6deme ge\u00e7mi\u015fi (Sipari\u015flerim)": "Grei\u00f0slusaga (Pantanir m\u00ednar)", // EN: Payment history (My Orders)
    "Faturaland\u0131rmay\u0131 y\u00f6net": "Stj\u00f3rna reikningum", // EN: Manage billing
    "Sipari\u015fle ilgili sorun mu var? Geri bildirim g\u00f6nder": "Vandam\u00e1l me\u00f0 p\u00f6ntun? Senda endurgj\u00f6f", // EN: Problem with an order? Send feedback
    "Haz\u0131r olanlar \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r durumda; haz\u0131r olmayanlar \"Yak\u0131nda\" olarak i\u015faretlidir.": "V\u00f6rur sem eru tilb\u00fanar virka n\u00fana; v\u00f6rur sem ekki eru tilb\u00fanar eru merktar \u201eV\u00e6ntanlegar\u201c.\\nStu\u00f0ningur vi\u00f0 Apple Watch V\u00e6ntanlegur", // EN: Ready items work now; items that are not ready are marked "Coming soon".
    "Apple Watch Deste\u011fi Yak\u0131nda": "NEXUS inniheldur ekki Apple Watch app enn. \u00deegar \u00fea\u00f0 ver\u00f0ur gefi\u00f0 \u00fat muntu geta keyrt svi\u00f0smyndir og s\u00e9\u00f0 mikilv\u00e6gar vi\u00f0varanir fr\u00e1 \u00falnli\u00f0num.", // EN: Apple Watch Support Coming Soon
    "NEXUS hen\u00fcz Apple Watch uygulamas\u0131 i\u00e7ermiyor. Yay\u0131nland\u0131\u011f\u0131nda bile\u011finden senaryolar\u0131 \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131p kritik uyar\u0131lar\u0131 g\u00f6rebileceksin.": "Hva\u00f0 \u00fe\u00fa getur gert \u00ed dag", // EN: NEXUS does not include an Apple Watch app yet. Once released, you will be able to run scenarios and see critical alerts from your wrist.
    "Bug\u00fcn Ne Yapabilirsin": "Haltu tilkynningum um mikilv\u00e6ga atbur\u00f0i kveiktum; \u00fe\u00fa s\u00e9r\u00f0 vi\u00f0varanir strax \u00ed s\u00edmanum \u00fe\u00ednum.", // EN: What You Can Do Today
    "Kritik olaylar i\u00e7in bildirimleri a\u00e7\u0131k tut; uyar\u0131lar\u0131 telefonunda hemen g\u00f6r\u00fcrs\u00fcn.": "Hvort \u00feessar tilkynningar birtast \u00e1 \u00falnli\u00f0num \u00fe\u00ednum fer eftir stillingum Watch \u00ed iPhone; NEXUS sendir ekkert s\u00e9rstakt til \u00falnli\u00f0sins.", // EN: Keep notifications on for critical events; you see alerts on your phone right away.
    "Saatinde bu bildirimlerin g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcp g\u00f6r\u00fcnmeyece\u011fi iPhone'unun Watch ayarlar\u0131na ba\u011fl\u0131d\u0131r; NEXUS saate \u00f6zel bir \u015fey g\u00f6ndermez.": "Opna stillingar tilkynninga", // EN: Whether these notifications show on your watch depends on your iPhone's Watch settings; NEXUS sends nothing specific to the watch.
    "Bildirim Ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 A\u00e7": "Afrita lykil", // EN: Open Notification Settings
    "Anahtar\u0131 kopyala": "Opna \u00ed au\u00f0kenningarforriti", // EN: Copy key
    "Kimlik uygulamas\u0131nda a\u00e7": "Ef \u00fe\u00fa missir a\u00f0gang a\u00f0 au\u00f0kenningarforriti \u00fe\u00ednu getur\u00f0u ekki skr\u00e1\u00f0 \u00feig inn, \u00fev\u00ed k\u00f3\u00f0i er krafist vi\u00f0 innskr\u00e1ningu. Vista\u00f0u \u00feennan lykil \u00e1 \u00f6ruggum sta\u00f0.", // EN: Open in authenticator app
    "Kimlik uygulamas\u0131na eri\u015fimini kaybedersen giri\u015fte kod istenece\u011fi i\u00e7in hesab\u0131na giremezsin. Bu anahtar\u0131 g\u00fcvenli bir yere kaydet.": "Lykill afrita\u00f0ur \u2713", // EN: If you lose access to your authenticator app you won't be able to sign in, because a code is required at login. Save this key somewhere safe.
    "Anahtar kopyaland\u0131 \u2713": "Gat ekki afrita\u00f0; sl\u00e1\u00f0u inn lykilinn handvirkt.", // EN: Key copied ✓
    "Kopyalanamad\u0131; anahtar\u0131 elle yaz.": "6-stafa k\u00f3\u00f0i", // EN: Couldn't copy; type the key by hand.
