    "Hesab\u0131m\u0131 Sil": "Ey\u00f0a reikningi m\u00ednum", // EN: Delete My Account
    "Hesab\u0131n, profilin ve senkronize verilerin kal\u0131c\u0131 olarak silinir. Aktif NEXUS+ aboneli\u011fin varsa \u00f6nce Faturaland\u0131rma'dan iptal et. Bu i\u015flem geri al\u0131namaz.": "Reikningur \u00feinn, pr\u00f3f\u00edll og samstilltar uppl\u00fdsingar eru varanlega eyddar. Ef \u00fe\u00fa \u00e1tt virkt NEXUS+ \u00e1skrift skaltu h\u00e6tta vi\u00f0 hana \u00ed Reikningsyfirliti fyrst. \u00deetta er ekki h\u00e6gt a\u00f0 afturkalla.", // EN: Your account, profile and synced data are permanently deleted. If you have an active NEXUS+ subscription, cancel it from Billing first. This cannot be undone.
    "Emin misin? Tekrar dokunarak sil": "Ertu viss? \u00der\u00fdstu aftur til a\u00f0 ey\u00f0a", // EN: Are you sure? Tap again to delete
    "Siliniyor\u2026": "Eyddi\u2026", // EN: Deleting…
    "Hesap silindi. Aboneli\u011fini Whop hesab\u0131ndan iptal etmeyi unutma.": "Reikningur eyddur. Mundu a\u00f0 h\u00e6tta vi\u00f0 \u00e1skrift \u00fe\u00edna \u00ed Whop reikningnum \u00fe\u00ednum.", // EN: Account deleted. Remember to cancel your subscription from your Whop account.
    "Hesab\u0131n ve verilerin silindi.": "Reikningur \u00feinn og g\u00f6gn voru eytt.", // EN: Your account and data were deleted.
    "Bu cihazdaki NEXUS verilerini silmek i\u00e7in Ayarlar \u2192 \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f Yap yeterli; bulut hesab\u0131 yok.": "Til a\u00f0 fjarl\u00e6gja NEXUS g\u00f6gn \u00e1 \u00feessari t\u00e6ki, er n\u00f3g a\u00f0 fara \u00ed Stillingar \u2192 Skr\u00e1 \u00fat; \u00fea\u00f0 er enginn sk\u00fdjareikningur.", // EN: To remove NEXUS data on this device, Settings → Sign out is enough; there is no cloud account.
    "Hesap silme fonksiyonu hen\u00fcz da\u011f\u0131t\u0131lmad\u0131. \u015eimdilik \u00e7\u0131k\u0131\u015f yapabilirsin.": "Ey\u00f0ing reiknings \u00e1 net\u00fej\u00f3ns hli\u00f0inni er ekki komin enn. \u00de\u00fa getur skr\u00e1\u00f0 \u00feig \u00fat fyrir n\u00fana.", // EN: The server-side account deletion isn't deployed yet. You can sign out for now.
    "! Rahats\u0131z etme modunu a\u00e7t\u0131m, hi\u00e7bir bildirim seni rahats\u0131z etmeyecek. [ACTION: ENABLE_DND]": "! \u00c9g virkja\u00f0i Ekki Maska \u00e1 mig; engar tilkynningar munu trufla \u00feig. [ACTION: ENABLE_DND]", // EN: ! I turned on Do Not Disturb; no notifications will bother you. [ACTION: ENABLE_DND]
    "\" senaryosunu \u015fimdilik ana ekrandaki T\u0131kla ve \u00c7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r kart\u0131ndan tek dokunu\u015fla \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131rabilirsin. NEXUS App Store'da yay\u0131nland\u0131\u011f\u0131nda bu ekrandan do\u011frudan Siri'ye ekleyebileceksin.": "\"Senario\" m\u00e1 keyra me\u00f0 einu striki fr\u00e1 'Tap to Run' spjaldinu \u00e1 heimaskj\u00e1num eins og er. \u00deegar NEXUS ver\u00f0ur \u00ed App Store, munt \u00fe\u00fa geta b\u00e6tt \u00fev\u00ed vi\u00f0 Siri beint fr\u00e1 \u00feessum skj\u00e1.", // EN: " scenario can be run with one tap from the Tap to Run card on the home screen for now. Once NEXUS is on the App Store, you'll be able to add it to Siri directly from this screen.
    "\" ve t\u00fcm ayarlar\u0131 kal\u0131c\u0131 olarak silinecek. Emin misin?": "Og allar stillingar \u00feess ver\u00f0a eytt a\u00f0 eil\u00edfu. Ertu viss?", // EN: " and all its settings will be deleted permanently. Are you sure?
