    "Aboneli\u011fin hemen sona erer ve bir sonraki \u00f6deme al\u0131nmaz.": "\u00c1skriftin \u00fe\u00edn endar strax og frekari grei\u00f0sla ver\u00f0ur ekki tekin.", // EN: Your subscription ends immediately and no further payment is taken.
    "Aboneli\u011finiz bulunmuyor.": "\u00de\u00fa \u00e1tt ekki \u00e1skrift.", // EN: You don't have a subscription.
    "Aboneli\u011finiz yok \u2014 t\u00fcm \u00f6zellikler \u015fu an \u00fccretsiz. NEXUS+ yak\u0131nda.": "\u00de\u00fa \u00e1tt ekki \u00e1skrift \u2014 hver eiginleiki er n\u00fa \u00f3keypis. NEXUS+ kemur br\u00e1\u00f0lega.", // EN: You don't have a subscription — every feature is free right now. NEXUS+ is coming soon.
    "Acil Durum D\u00fc\u011fmesi": "Ney\u00f0arhnappur", // EN: Emergency Button
    "Acil Durum D\u00fc\u011fmesi (Bluetooth)": "Ney\u00f0arhnappur (Bluetooth)", // EN: Emergency Button (Bluetooth)
    "Acil Durum D\u00fc\u011fmesi (Zigbee)": "Ney\u00f0arhnappur (Zigbee)", // EN: Emergency Button (Zigbee)
    "Acil Durumlar": "Ney\u00f0aratvik", // EN: Emergencies
    "Ad": "Nafn", // EN: Name
    "Ad Soyad": "Fullt nafn", // EN: Full Name
    "Kullan\u0131c\u0131 ad\u0131": "Notandanafn", // EN: Username
    "Adres biliyorsan tek tek yaz, bilmiyorsan modem a\u011f\u0131n\u0131n \u00f6n ekini b\u0131rak (192.168.1 gibi) \u2014 NEXUS 254 adresi birlikte yoklar.": "Ef \u00fe\u00fa \u00feekkir netfangi\u00f0, sl\u00e1\u00f0u \u00fea\u00f0 inn; ef ekki, skaltu skilja eftir forli\u00f0 netbeinisins \u00fe\u00edns (eins og 192.168.1) \u2014 NEXUS athugar \u00f6ll 254 netf\u00f6ng.", // EN: If you know the address, type it; if not, leave your router network prefix (like 192.168.1) — NEXUS checks all 254 addresses.
    "Adres veya semt ara": "Leita a\u00f0 netfangi e\u00f0a hverfi", // EN: Search address or neighborhood
    "Ads\u0131z cihaz": "\u00d3nefnd t\u00e6ki", // EN: Unnamed device
    "Aile": "Fj\u00f6lskylda", // EN: Family
    "Aile mesajla\u015fma \u00f6zelli\u011fi": "Fj\u00f6lskylduskilabo\u00f0aeiginleiki", // EN: Family messaging feature
    "Aksiyon \u00d6zeti": "Yfirlit a\u00f0ger\u00f0a", // EN: Action Summary
    "Aktar\u0131lan Cihaz": "Tengdu t\u00e6ki", // EN: Bridged Devices
    "Aktif": "Virk", // EN: Active
    "Aktif \u00b7 G\u00fcvenli": "Virk \u00b7 \u00d6rugg", // EN: Active · Secure
    "\u00d6nce bir cihaz ekle": "B\u00e6ttu t\u00e6ki fyrst vi\u00f0", // EN: Add a device first
    "\u00c7\u0131kmadan \u00f6nce": "\u00c1\u00f0ur en \u00fe\u00fa fer\u00f0", // EN: Before you leave
    "Cihazlar\u0131n\u0131n son bilinen durumu. Okunmayan bir de\u011fer varsa \"Durum okunmad\u0131\" yazar.": "S\u00ed\u00f0asta \u00feekkta \u00e1stand t\u00e6kjanna \u00feinna. Gildi sem var ekki lesi\u00f0 s\u00fdnir \u201e\u00c1stand ekki lesi\u00f0\u201c.", // EN: Last known state of your devices. A value that was not read shows "State not read".
    "A\u00c7IK G\u00d6R\u00dcNEN C\u0130HAZLAR": "T\u00c6KI SEM VIRI\u00d0 ERN", // EN: DEVICES THAT APPEAR ON
    "A\u00e7\u0131k g\u00f6r\u00fcnen cihaz yok.": "Ekkert t\u00e6ki vir\u00f0ist vera kveikt.", // EN: No device appears to be on.
    "G\u00dcVENL\u0130K C\u0130HAZLARI": "\u00d6RYGGIST\u00c6KI", // EN: SECURITY DEVICES
    "Kilit, kap\u0131 sens\u00f6r\u00fc veya kamera eklenmemi\u015f.": "Engin l\u00e1s, hur\u00f0arskynjari e\u00f0a myndav\u00e9l b\u00e6tt vi\u00f0.", // EN: No lock, door sensor or camera added.
    "Durum okunmad\u0131": "\u00c1stand ekki lesi\u00f0", // EN: State not read
    "Bu zaten \u015fu an kulland\u0131\u011f\u0131n e-posta adresi. Farkl\u0131 bir adres gir.": "\u00deetta er n\u00fa \u00feegar netfangi\u00f0 sem \u00fe\u00fa ert a\u00f0 nota. Sl\u00e1\u00f0u inn anna\u00f0.", // EN: This is already the email address you are using. Enter a different one.
    "Bu e-posta adresi ba\u015fka bir hesapta kay\u0131tl\u0131. Ba\u015fka bir adres dene.": "\u00deetta netfang er skr\u00e1\u00f0 hj\u00e1 \u00f6\u00f0ru reikningi. Reyndu anna\u00f0.\\nOf margar tilraunir. Reyndu aftur eftir nokkrar m\u00edn\u00fatur.", // EN: This email address is registered to another account. Try a different one.
    "\u00c7ok s\u0131k denendi. Birka\u00e7 dakika sonra tekrar dene.": "\u00d3tengd", // EN: Too many attempts. Try again in a few minutes.
    "\u00c7evrimd\u0131\u015f\u0131": "Markmi\u00f0i\u00f0 ekki lesi\u00f0", // EN: Offline
    "Hedef okunmad\u0131": "Engin m\u00e6lig\u00f6gn", // EN: Target not read
    "\u00d6l\u00e7\u00fcm verisi yok": "Engin m\u00e6lig\u00f6gn", // EN: No measurement data
    "Ekledi\u011fin cihazlar hen\u00fcz s\u0131cakl\u0131k, nem veya hava kalitesi verisi vermedi. Sens\u00f6r\u00fcn a\u00e7\u0131k ve a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "T\u00e6kin \u00fe\u00edn hafa ekki skr\u00e1\u00f0 hitastig, loftg\u00e6\u00f0i e\u00f0a rakastig enn. Gakktu \u00far skugga um a\u00f0 skynjarinn s\u00e9 kveiktur og \u00e1 netinu.", // EN: Your devices have not reported temperature, humidity or air quality yet. Make sure the sensor is on and on the network.
    "Son okunan \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcmler": "N\u00fdjustu m\u00e6lingar", // EN: Latest readings
    "Skor \u00fcretmiyoruz; yaln\u0131zca cihazlardan okunan ger\u00e7ek de\u011ferler g\u00f6sterilir.": "Vi\u00f0 framlei\u00f0um ekki einkunn; a\u00f0eins raunverulegar m\u00e6lingar sem teknar eru fr\u00e1 t\u00e6kinu \u00fe\u00ednu eru s\u00fdndar.", // EN: We do not produce a score; only real values read from your devices are shown.
    "Haz\u0131rl\u0131\u011f\u0131 bitirdi\u011finde \u015fu cihazlara uygulan\u0131r.": "\u00deegar \u00fe\u00fa l\u00fdkur, er \u00feetta beitt \u00e1 eftirfarandi t\u00e6ki.", // EN: When you finish, this is applied to the following devices.
    "Uyku haz\u0131rl\u0131\u011f\u0131 i\u00e7in uygun cihaz yok": "Engin hentug t\u00e6ki til undirb\u00fanings svefns", // EN: No suitable device for sleep preparation
    "I\u015f\u0131k, perde, kilit veya iklim cihaz\u0131 ekledi\u011finde haz\u0131rl\u0131k burada listelenir.": "\u00deegar \u00fe\u00fa b\u00e6tir vi\u00f0 lj\u00f3si, gard\u00ednum, l\u00e6singu e\u00f0a loftslagst\u00e6ki, ver\u00f0ur undirb\u00faningurinn skr\u00e1\u00f0ur h\u00e9r.", // EN: Once you add a light, curtain, lock or climate device, the preparation is listed here.
    "\u0130klim cihazlar\u0131n\u0131n son bilinen durumu ve okunan \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcmler.": "S\u00ed\u00f0asta vita\u00f0a \u00e1stand og m\u00e6lingar \u00e1 loftslagi t\u00e6kja \u00feinna.", // EN: Last known state and readings of your climate devices.
    "Kamera gizlili\u011fi": "A\u00f0gangsleyfi myndav\u00e9la", // EN: Camera privacy
    "Her kameran\u0131n gizlilik modunu ayr\u0131 ayr\u0131 y\u00f6net.": "Stj\u00f3rna\u00f0u a\u00f0gangsleyfisstillingu hverrar myndav\u00e9lar s\u00e9rstaklega.", // EN: Manage each camera's privacy mode separately.
    "Kamera cihaz\u0131 yok": "Engin myndav\u00e9lart\u00e6ki", // EN: No camera device
    "Kamera ekledi\u011finde gizlilik modu her kamera i\u00e7in burada g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr.": "\u00deegar \u00fe\u00fa b\u00e6tir vi\u00f0 myndav\u00e9l, birtist a\u00f0gangsleyfisstilling hennar h\u00e9r.", // EN: Once you add a camera, its privacy mode appears here.
    "Bu senaryoyu uygulayacak uygun cihaz yok": "Engin hentug t\u00e6ki til a\u00f0 keyra \u00feetta atri\u00f0i", // EN: No suitable device to run this scenario
    "I\u015f\u0131k, perde, klima veya kilit gibi uyumlu bir cihaz ekledi\u011finde burada listelenir.": "\u00deegar \u00fe\u00fa b\u00e6tir vi\u00f0 samh\u00e6f\u00f0u t\u00e6ki eins og lj\u00f3si, gard\u00edni, loftk\u00e6lingu e\u00f0a l\u00e6singu, ver\u00f0ur \u00fea\u00f0 skr\u00e1\u00f0 h\u00e9r.", // EN: Once you add a compatible device such as a light, curtain, air conditioner or lock, it is listed here.
