    "Ak\u0131ll\u0131 prizleri ve enerji t\u00fcketen cihazlar\u0131 y\u00f6neten bir enerji tasarruf paneli olu\u015ftur. H\u0131zl\u0131 kapatma, eko profiller, zamanlanm\u0131\u015f tasarruf ve t\u00fcketim \u00f6zetleri ekle.": "B\u00fa\u00f0u til orkusp\u00f6runarstj\u00f3rnbor\u00f0 sem st\u00fdrir snjalltengjum og orkuneytandi t\u00e6kjum. B\u00e6ttu vi\u00f0 hra\u00f0sl\u00f6kki, umhverfisv\u00e6num pr\u00f3f\u00edlum, skipul\u00f6g\u00f0um sparna\u00f0i og notkunaryfirliti.", // EN: Create an energy saving panel that manages smart plugs and energy-consuming devices. Add quick shut-off, eco profiles, scheduled saving and usage summaries.
