    "Buluta ula\u015f\u0131lamad\u0131. \u0130nternet ba\u011flant\u0131n\u0131 kontrol et.": "T\u00f3kst ekki a\u00f0 n\u00e1 \u00ed sk\u00fd. Athuga\u00f0u nettengingu \u00fe\u00edna.", // EN: Couldn't reach the cloud. Check your internet connection.
    "Bunu tam \u00e7\u00f6zemedim. A\u015fa\u011f\u0131daki formdan ekibimize geri bildirim g\u00f6nderirsen en k\u0131sa s\u00fcrede d\u00f6n\u00fc\u015f yapal\u0131m; ya da \"Tam sohbeti a\u00e7\" ile devam edebilirsin.": "\u00c9g gat ekki leyst \u00feetta fullkomlega. Sendu endurgj\u00f6f til li\u00f0sins okkar me\u00f0 formi h\u00e9r a\u00f0 ne\u00f0an og vi\u00f0 munum hafa samband vi\u00f0 \u00feig eins flj\u00f3tt og au\u00f0i\u00f0 er, e\u00f0a haltu \u00e1fram me\u00f0 \"Opna fullan spjall\".", // EN: I couldn't fully solve that. Send our team feedback with the form below and we'll get back to you as soon as we can, or continue with "Open full chat".
