    "Canl\u0131 g\u00f6r\u00fcnt\u00fc g\u00f6stermek i\u00e7in \u00f6nce kamera e\u015fle\u015ftir.": "Para\u00f0u myndav\u00e9l fyrst til a\u00f0 s\u00fdna beina mynd.", // EN: Pair a camera first to show live video.
