    "Foto\u011fraf kaydedilemedi; cihaz depolamas\u0131 dolu olabilir.": "T\u00f3kst ekki a\u00f0 vista myndina; geymsla t\u00e6kis g\u00e6ti veri\u00f0 full.", // EN: Couldn't save the photo; device storage may be full.
