    "Foto\u011fraf okunamad\u0131; ba\u015fka bir dosya dene.": "T\u00f3kst ekki a\u00f0 lesa mynd; reyndu a\u00f0ra skr\u00e1.", // EN: Couldn't read the photo; try another file.
