    "Cihaz ekledik\u00e7e tasarrufun burada g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr.": "Sparna\u00f0urinn \u00feinn birtist h\u00e9r \u00feegar \u00fe\u00fa b\u00e6tir vi\u00f0 t\u00e6kjum.", // EN: Your savings appear here as you add devices.
