    "Cihaz eklenince h\u0131zl\u0131 olu\u015fturma \u00f6nerileri burada g\u00f6r\u00fcnecek.": "Hra\u00f0sk\u00f6punartill\u00f6gur birtast h\u00e9r \u00feegar \u00fe\u00fa b\u00e6tir vi\u00f0 t\u00e6kjum.", // EN: Quick creation suggestions will appear here once you add devices.
    "Cihaz eklenince kontrol g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr.": "St\u00fdringar birtast \u00feegar t\u00e6ki hefur veri\u00f0 b\u00e6tt vi\u00f0.", // EN: Controls appear once a device is added.
    "Cihaz g\u00fcncellemeleri": "Uppf\u00e6rslur t\u00e6kis", // EN: Device updates
    "Cihaz kald\u0131r\u0131ls\u0131n m\u0131?": "Fjarstilla t\u00e6ki\u00f0?", // EN: Remove the device?
    "Cihaz tan\u0131n\u0131yor\u2026": "A\u00f0 bera kennsl \u00e1 t\u00e6ki\u00f0\u2026", // EN: Identifying the device…
    "Cihaz uyar\u0131lar\u0131n\u0131, \u00e7a\u011fr\u0131 kay\u0131tlar\u0131n\u0131 ve \u00f6nemli durum mesajlar\u0131n\u0131 tek merkezden takip edin.": "Fylgstu me\u00f0 vi\u00f0v\u00f6runum t\u00e6kis, s\u00edmtalaskr\u00e1m og mikilv\u00e6gum st\u00f6\u00f0umeldum fr\u00e1 einni mi\u00f0st\u00f6\u00f0.", // EN: Track device alerts, call logs and important status messages from one center.
