    "S\u00fcr\u00fcm\u00fc g\u00f6r\u00fcnt\u00fcle, yeni s\u00fcr\u00fcm\u00fc buradan kontrol et ve y\u00fckle.": "Sko\u00f0a \u00fatg\u00e1fu, leita a\u00f0 n\u00fdrri \u00fatg\u00e1fu h\u00e9r og setja upp.", // EN: View the version, check for a new version here and install it.
