    "Cihazlar\u0131n durumu de\u011fi\u015fti\u011finde di\u011fer senaryolar\u0131 otomatik olarak tetikleyin.": "Kveikja \u00e1 \u00f6\u00f0rum vi\u00f0bur\u00f0um sj\u00e1lfkrafa \u00feegar st\u00f6\u00f0u t\u00e6kisins \u00fe\u00edns breytist.", // EN: Trigger other scenarios automatically when your devices' status changes.
    "Cihazlar\u0131na dair i\u00e7g\u00f6r\u00fcler edin, stratejilerle otomatik tasarruf et.": "F\u00e1\u00f0u inns\u00fdn \u00ed t\u00e6kin \u00fe\u00edn og vista\u00f0u sj\u00e1lfkrafa me\u00f0 a\u00f0fer\u00f0um.", // EN: Get insights about your devices and save automatically with strategies.
    "Cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 otomatik tarama, QR kod, kurulum kodu ya da manuel katalog ile ekleyebilirsin.": "\u00de\u00fa getur b\u00e6tt vi\u00f0 t\u00e6kjum me\u00f0 sj\u00e1lfvirkri leit, QR k\u00f3\u00f0a, uppsetningark\u00f3\u00f0a e\u00f0a handvirkri skr\u00e1.", // EN: You can add your devices with automatic scan, QR code, setup code or the manual catalog.
    "Cihazlar\u0131n\u0131za dair i\u00e7g\u00f6r\u00fcler edinin ve enerji ipu\u00e7lar\u0131 al\u0131n.": "F\u00e1\u00f0u inns\u00fdn \u00ed t\u00e6kin \u00fe\u00edn og orkura\u00f0leggingar.", // EN: Get insights about your devices and energy tips.
