    "Cihaz\u0131 Se\u00e7": "Velja t\u00e6ki", // EN: Select Device
    "Cihaz\u0131 kald\u0131r": "Fjarl\u00e6gja t\u00e6ki", // EN: Remove device
    "Cihaz\u0131m neden \u00e7evrimd\u0131\u015f\u0131 g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcyor?": "Af hverju s\u00fdnir t\u00e6ki\u00f0 mitt sem \u00f3virkt?", // EN: Why does my device show as offline?
    "Cihaz\u0131n IP adresini yaz, NEXUS konu\u015fabildi\u011fi protokol\u00fc kendisi anlas\u0131n.": "Sl\u00e1\u00f0u inn IP-t\u00f6lu t\u00e6kisins og NEXUS finnur \u00fat hva\u00f0a samskiptareglur \u00fea\u00f0 notar.", // EN: Type the device's IP address and NEXUS figures out which protocol it speaks.
    "Cihaz\u0131n Wi-Fi ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 ve modemini kontrol et. Sorun s\u00fcrerse cihaz\u0131 kald\u0131r\u0131p yeniden ekle. Ad\u0131mlar: Cihazlar > cihaz\u0131 se\u00e7 > Kald\u0131r.": "Athuga\u00f0u Wi-Fi tengingu t\u00e6kisins og beinirinn \u00feinn. Ef vandam\u00e1li\u00f0 heldur \u00e1fram, fjarl\u00e6g\u00f0u t\u00e6ki\u00f0 og b\u00e6ttu \u00fev\u00ed aftur vi\u00f0. Skref: T\u00e6ki > veldu t\u00e6ki\u00f0 > Fjarl\u00e6gja.", // EN: Check the device's Wi-Fi connection and your router. If the problem continues, remove the device and add it again. Steps: Devices > choose the device > Remove.
    "Cihaz\u0131n Wi-Fi ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 ve modeminizi kontrol edin. Sorun s\u00fcrerse cihaz\u0131 NEXUS uygulamas\u0131ndan kald\u0131r\u0131p yeniden ekleyin.": "Athuga\u00f0u Wi-Fi tengingu t\u00e6kisins og beinirinn \u00feinn. Ef vandam\u00e1li\u00f0 heldur \u00e1fram, fjarl\u00e6g\u00f0u t\u00e6ki\u00f0 \u00far NEXUS appinu og b\u00e6ttu \u00fev\u00ed aftur vi\u00f0.", // EN: Check the device's Wi-Fi connection and your router. If the problem continues, remove the device from the NEXUS app and add it again.
    "Cihaz\u0131n g\u00f6r\u00fcnm\u00fcyorsa QR tarama veya kurulum kodu yolunu kullan. Destek ve y\u00f6nlendirme i\u00e7in yard\u0131m sayfas\u0131n\u0131 a\u00e7abilirsin.": "Ef t\u00e6ki\u00f0 \u00feitt birtist ekki, nota\u00f0u QR sk\u00f6nnun e\u00f0a uppsetningark\u00f3\u00f0a. \u00de\u00fa getur opna\u00f0 hj\u00e1lpars\u00ed\u00f0u fyrir a\u00f0sto\u00f0 og lei\u00f0beiningar.", // EN: If your device doesn't show up, use QR scanning or a setup code. You can open the help page for support and guidance.
    "Cihaz\u0131n konum (GPS) servisi kapal\u0131. A\u00e7\u0131p tekrar dene.": "Sta\u00f0setningar\u00fej\u00f3nusta (GPS) t\u00e6kisins \u00fe\u00edns er sl\u00f6kkt. Kveiktu \u00e1 henni og reyndu aftur.", // EN: Your device's location (GPS) service is off. Turn it on and try again.
    "Cihaz\u0131n konum servisini desteklemiyor.": "T\u00e6ki\u00f0 \u00feitt sty\u00f0ur ekki sta\u00f0setningar\u00fej\u00f3nustu.", // EN: Your device doesn't support location services.
    "Cihaz\u0131n listede yok mu? Geri bildirim g\u00f6nder": "T\u00e6ki ekki \u00e1 listanum? Senda \u00e1bendingu", // EN: Device not on the list? Send feedback
