    "T\u00fcm odalar": "\u00d6ll herbergi", // EN: All rooms
    "Yan\u0131tla": "Svara\u00f0u", // EN: Reply
    "Haftal\u0131k \u00d6zet": "Vikuleg samantekt", // EN: Weekly Summary
    "Notlar": "Athugasemdir", // EN: Notes
    "Pano bo\u015f": "Bor\u00f0i\u00f0 er t\u00f3mt", // EN: Board is empty
    "Maddeyi Sil": "Ey\u00f0a atri\u00f0i", // EN: Delete Item
    "Mesaj yaz\u2026": "Sl\u00e1\u00f0u inn skilabo\u00f0\u2026", // EN: Type a message…
    "Hen\u00fcz okunmad\u0131": "Ekki lesi\u00f0 enn", // EN: Not read yet
    "senaryo \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131rd\u0131": "Keyr\u00f0i atri\u00f0i", // EN: ran a scene
    "uyar\u0131 payla\u015ft\u0131": "Deildi vi\u00f0v\u00f6run", // EN: shared an alert
    "Bu hafta kayda de\u011fer bir etkinlik yok. Senaryo \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131rmalar\u0131 ve uyar\u0131lar burada toplan\u0131r.": "Engin athyglisver\u00f0 virkni \u00feessa vikuna. Atri\u00f0i og vi\u00f0varanir safnast h\u00e9r.", // EN: No notable activity this week. Scene runs and alerts gather here.
    "Al\u0131\u015fveri\u015f listesi, ev i\u015fleri ya da k\u0131sa notlar \u2014 ailenle payla\u015ft\u0131\u011f\u0131n ilk maddeyi ekle.": "Innkaupalisti, heimilisverk e\u00f0a flj\u00f3tar athugasemdir \u2014 b\u00e6ttu vi\u00f0 fyrsta atri\u00f0inu til a\u00f0 deila me\u00f0 fj\u00f6lskyldunni \u00feinni.", // EN: Shopping list, chores or quick notes — add the first item to share with your family.
    "Ev Panosu evin \u00fcyeleri aras\u0131ndad\u0131r. Ev Y\u00f6netimi'nden ev olu\u015ftur ya da davetle kat\u0131l.": "Bor\u00f0i\u00f0 tilheyrir me\u00f0limum heimilisins. B\u00fa\u00f0u til heimili \u00ed Stj\u00f3rnun heimilis e\u00f0a vertu me\u00f0 me\u00f0 bo\u00f0i.", // EN: The board belongs to your home's members. Create a home from Home Management or join by invite.
    "Bu madde panodan t\u00fcm \u00fcyeler i\u00e7in kald\u0131r\u0131l\u0131r.": "\u00deetta atri\u00f0i er fjarl\u00e6gt af bor\u00f0i fyrir alla me\u00f0limi.", // EN: This item is removed from the board for all members.
    "Pano \u015fu an kapal\u0131.": "Bor\u00f0i\u00f0 er ekki \u00ed bo\u00f0i n\u00fana.", // EN: The board is unavailable right now.
    "Ev Panosu i\u00e7in oturum a\u00e7mal\u0131s\u0131n.": "Skr\u00e1\u00f0u \u00feig inn til a\u00f0 nota Heimilisbor\u00f0.", // EN: Sign in to use the Home Board.
    "Ev Panosu bu s\u00fcr\u00fcmde kullan\u0131lam\u0131yor.": "Heimilisbor\u00f0 er ekki \u00ed bo\u00f0i \u00ed \u00feessari \u00fatg\u00e1fu.", // EN: Home Board is unavailable in this build.
    "Pano y\u00fckleniyor\u2026": "Hle\u00f0ur spjaldi\u00f0\u2026", // EN: Loading board…
    "Listeye ekle ya da not yaz\u2026": "B\u00e6ta vi\u00f0 \u00ed listann e\u00f0a skrifa athugasemd\u2026", // EN: Add to the list or write a note…
    "T\u00fcr de\u011fi\u015ftir: liste maddesi / not": "Skiptu um ger\u00f0: lista atri\u00f0i / athugasemd", // EN: Switch type: list item / note
    "Yan\u0131ttan vazge\u00e7": "H\u00e6tta vi\u00f0 svar", // EN: Cancel reply
    "Bulut ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 kapal\u0131 oldu\u011fu i\u00e7in pano kullan\u0131lam\u0131yor.": "Spjaldi\u00f0 er ekki \u00ed bo\u00f0i vegna \u00feess a\u00f0 sk\u00fdjatenging er sl\u00f6kkt.", // EN: The board is unavailable because the cloud connection is off.
    "Hen\u00fcz bir evin yok": "\u00de\u00fa \u00e1tt ekki heimili enn", // EN: You don't have a home yet
    "tamamlad\u0131": "kl\u00e1ra\u00f0 \u00fea\u00f0", // EN: completed it
    "Bir \u00fcye": "Me\u00f0limur", // EN: A member
    "Evim": "Heimili\u00f0 mitt", // EN: My Home
    "Evindeki odalar\u0131 ekle veya kald\u0131r.": "B\u00e6ta vi\u00f0 e\u00f0a fjarl\u00e6gja herbergi \u00ed heimilinu \u00fe\u00ednu.", // EN: Add or remove rooms in your home.
    "Evindeki t\u00fcm ayd\u0131nlatma cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 kontrol et": "Stj\u00f3rna \u00f6llum lj\u00f3skerum \u00ed heimilinu \u00fe\u00ednu", // EN: Control all lighting devices in your home
    "Evine bir isim ver.": "Gef\u00f0u heimilinu \u00fe\u00ednu nafn.", // EN: Give your home a name.
