    "Harika bir fikir! \u0130stedi\u011fin detaylara g\u00f6re yeni bir ak\u0131ll\u0131 senaryo kurgulad\u0131m ve hemen \"T\u0131kla ve \u00c7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\" sekmesine ekledim. A\u015fa\u011f\u0131dan hemen g\u00f6z atabilirsin! [ACTION: CREATE_SCENARIO]": "Fr\u00e1b\u00e6rt hugmynd! \u00c9g hef b\u00fai\u00f0 til n\u00fdtt snjallt senario \u00fat fr\u00e1 uppl\u00fdsingunum \u00fe\u00ednum og b\u00e6tt \u00fev\u00ed vi\u00f0 flipann \u201eSmelltu til a\u00f0 keyra\u201c. Taktu eina k\u00edk ni\u00f0ur! [ACTION: CREATE_SCENARIO]", // EN: Great idea! I've built a new smart scenario from your details and added it to the "Tap to Run" tab. Take a look below! [ACTION: CREATE_SCENARIO]
