    "Hen\u00fcz enerji tasarrufu destekleyen bir cihaz\u0131n yok, l\u00fctfen \u00f6ncelikle ekle.": "\u00de\u00fa \u00e1tt ekki t\u00e6ki sem sty\u00f0ur orkusp\u00f6run enn; vinsamlegast b\u00e6ttu \u00fev\u00ed fyrst vi\u00f0.", // EN: You don't have a device that supports energy saving yet; please add one first.
