    "Kilit, kamera veya sens\u00f6r ekledi\u011finde tarama onlar\u0131 da kontrol eder.": "\u00deegar \u00fe\u00fa b\u00e6tir vi\u00f0 l\u00e6singu, myndav\u00e9l e\u00f0a skynjara, \u00fe\u00e1 athugar sk\u00f6nnunin \u00fea\u00f0 l\u00edka.", // EN: When you add a lock, camera or sensor, the scan checks those too.
