    "NEXUS AI ak\u0131ll\u0131 ev kontrol\u00fc": "NEXUS AI sj\u00e1lfvirk heimilisst\u00fdring", // EN: NEXUS AI smart home control
    "NEXUS AI al\u0131\u015fkanl\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 \u00f6\u011frenir ve evinizi size \u00f6zel m\u00fckemmel bir ya\u015fam alan\u0131na d\u00f6n\u00fc\u015ft\u00fcr\u00fcr.": "NEXUS AI l\u00e6rir venjur \u00fe\u00ednar og breytir heimili \u00fe\u00ednu \u00ed l\u00edflegt r\u00fdmi sem er gert s\u00e9rstaklega fyrir \u00feig.", // EN: NEXUS AI learns your habits and turns your home into a living space made just for you.
    "NEXUS AI ile her \u015feyi olu\u015fturun": "B\u00fa\u00f0u til hva\u00f0 sem er me\u00f0 NEXUS AI", // EN: Create anything with NEXUS AI
    "NEXUS AI ile sohbet et": "Spjalla\u00f0u vi\u00f0 NEXUS AI", // EN: Chat with NEXUS AI
    "NEXUS AI ile yapt\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131z her g\u00f6r\u00fc\u015fme puan kullan\u0131r. Puanlar her g\u00fcn yenilenir.": "Hvert samtal vi\u00f0 NEXUS AI notar punkta. Punktar endurn\u00fdjast \u00e1 hverjum degi.", // EN: Each conversation with NEXUS AI uses points. Points renew every day.
    "NEXUS AI puanlar\u0131 nedir?": "Hva\u00f0 eru NEXUS AI punktar?", // EN: What are NEXUS AI points?
    "NEXUS AI puanlar\u0131n her g\u00fcn yenilenir; \u015fu an t\u00fcm \u00f6zellikler \u00fccretsiz.": "NEXUS AI punktarnir \u00fe\u00ednir endurn\u00fdjast \u00e1 hverjum degi; hver a\u00f0ger\u00f0 er \u00f3keypis n\u00fana.", // EN: Your NEXUS AI points renew every day; every feature is free right now.
