    "NEXUS Y\u00f6nlendiriliyor...": "V\u00edsa\u00f0 \u00e1fram til NEXUS...", // EN: Redirecting to NEXUS...
    "NEXUS i\u00e7inde \"Bir Eve Kat\u0131l\" alan\u0131na bu kodu girerek kat\u0131labilirsin.": "\u00de\u00fa getur teki\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e1tt me\u00f0 \u00fev\u00ed a\u00f0 sl\u00e1 inn \u00feennan k\u00f3\u00f0a \u00ed \u201eJoin a Home\u201c innan NEXUS.", // EN: You can join by entering this code in "Join a Home" inside NEXUS.
    "NEXUS senaryolar\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 Siri komutlar\u0131yla saniyeler i\u00e7inde sesle \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131n.": "Keyr\u00f0u NEXUS senur \u00fe\u00ednar me\u00f0 r\u00f6ddinni me\u00f0 Siri \u00e1 sek\u00fandum.", // EN: Run your NEXUS scenarios by voice with Siri in seconds.
    "NEXUS yerel \u00f6ncelikli \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r: cihaz verilerin bu cihazda kal\u0131r, cihaz komutlar\u0131 do\u011frudan yerel a\u011fdan gider ve \u00fc\u00e7\u00fcnc\u00fc taraflarla payla\u015f\u0131lmaz.": "NEXUS er fyrst og fremst sta\u00f0bundi\u00f0: g\u00f6gnin \u00e1 t\u00e6kinu \u00fe\u00ednu ver\u00f0a \u00e1 \u00feessu t\u00e6ki, t\u00e6knif\u00e6rsla fer beint yfir sta\u00f0bundi\u00f0 net \u00feitt, og ekkert er deilt me\u00f0 \u00feri\u00f0ja a\u00f0ila.", // EN: NEXUS is local-first: your device data stays on this device, device commands go straight over your local network, and nothing is shared with third parties.
