    "NEXUS'u di\u011fer platformlara ba\u011flayarak cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 her yerden kontrol et.": "Tengdu NEXUS vi\u00f0 \u00f6nnur kerfi til a\u00f0 stj\u00f3rna t\u00e6kjunum \u00fe\u00ednum hvar sem er.", // EN: Connect NEXUS to other platforms to control your devices from anywhere.
    "Bu hizmet ba\u011flant\u0131lar\u0131 hen\u00fcz kullan\u0131labilir de\u011fil. \u00dc\u00e7\u00fcnc\u00fc taraf cihazlar i\u00e7in Entegrasyonlar'dan Home Assistant'\u0131 kullanabilirsin.": "\u00deessar \u00fej\u00f3nustutengingar eru ekki tilt\u00e6kar enn. Fyrir t\u00e6ki fr\u00e1 \u00feri\u00f0ja a\u00f0ila getur\u00f0u nota\u00f0 Home Assistant \u00ed Gegn\u00fe\u00e1ttum.", // EN: These service connections are not available yet. For third-party devices, you can use Home Assistant from Integrations.
    "NEXUS+ Ayl\u0131k": "NEXUS+ M\u00e1na\u00f0arlega", // EN: NEXUS+ Monthly
    "NEXUS+ Y\u0131ll\u0131k": "NEXUS+ \u00c1rlega", // EN: NEXUS+ Yearly
    "NEXUS+ aboneli\u011fi ba\u015flat\u0131ld\u0131": "NEXUS+ \u00e1skrift hafin", // EN: NEXUS+ subscription started
    "NEXUS+ aboneli\u011fi iptal edildi": "NEXUS+ \u00e1skrift felld ni\u00f0ur", // EN: NEXUS+ subscription cancelled
    "NEXUS+ hen\u00fcz sat\u0131\u015fta de\u011fil. Cihaz ekleme, kontrol panelleri, senaryolar ve NEXUS AI \u015fu an tamamen \u00fccretsiz; abonelik a\u00e7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda buradan haber verece\u011fiz.": "NEXUS+ er ekki til s\u00f6lu enn. A\u00f0 b\u00e6ta vi\u00f0 t\u00e6kjum, svi\u00f0smyndum og NEXUS AI er alveg \u00f3keypis n\u00fana; vi\u00f0 l\u00e1tum \u00feig vita h\u00e9r \u00feegar \u00e1skriftir opna.", // EN: NEXUS+ isn't on sale yet. Adding devices, scenarios and NEXUS AI are completely free right now; we'll let you know here when subscriptions open.
