    "Pi\u015firme sonras\u0131 karbonmonoksit seviyesi hafif y\u00fckselmi\u015f. Pencereyi a\u00e7man\u0131z \u00f6nerilir.": "Kolm\u00f3n\u00f3x\u00ed\u00f0 h\u00e6kka\u00f0i a\u00f0eins eftir eldun. M\u00e6lt er me\u00f0 a\u00f0 opna glugga.", // EN: Carbon monoxide rose slightly after cooking. Opening a window is recommended.
