    "Bu adreste bir cihaz var ama NEXUS protokol\u00fc konu\u015fmuyor.": "\u00dea\u00f0 er t\u00e6ki \u00e1 \u00feessari heimilisfangi, en \u00fea\u00f0 talar ekki NEXUS samskiptaregluna.", // EN: There is a device at this address, but it does not speak a NEXUS protocol.
    "Bu cihaz zaten ekli.": "\u00deetta t\u00e6ki hefur \u00feegar veri\u00f0 b\u00e6tt vi\u00f0.", // EN: This device is already added.
    "E\u015fle\u015ftir ve ekle": "Para og b\u00e6ta vi\u00f0", // EN: Pair and add
    "E\u015fle\u015ftirme kodu ge\u00e7ersiz. 11 haneli kodu ya da MT: ile ba\u015flayan QR i\u00e7eri\u011fini gir.": "P\u00f6runark\u00f3\u00f0inn er ekki gildur. Sl\u00e1\u00f0u inn 11 stafa k\u00f3\u00f0ann e\u00f0a QR-innihaldi\u00f0 sem byrjar \u00e1 MT:.", // EN: The pairing code is not valid. Enter the 11-digit code or the QR content that starts with MT:.
    "Bu kodu NEXUS masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131nda gir. Cihaz Wi-Fi ile ba\u011fl\u0131ysa yerel a\u011fdan IP adresiyle de ekleyebilirsin.": "Sl\u00e1\u00f0u inn \u00feennan k\u00f3\u00f0a \u00ed NEXUS skj\u00e1bor\u00f0sforritinu. Ef t\u00e6ki\u00f0 er \u00e1 Wi-Fi getur\u00f0u einnig b\u00e6tt \u00fev\u00ed vi\u00f0 \u00far sta\u00f0arneti me\u00f0 IP t\u00f6lu \u00feess.", // EN: Enter this code in the NEXUS desktop app. If the device is on Wi-Fi, you can also add it from your local network by its IP address.
    "Cihaz ayn\u0131 a\u011fda aran\u0131yor ve e\u015fle\u015ftiriliyor. Bu bir dakikay\u0131 bulabilir; cihaz\u0131n a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda olmas\u0131 gerekir.": "Leita\u00f0 er a\u00f0 t\u00e6kinu \u00e1 sama neti og \u00fea\u00f0 er \u00ed p\u00f6run. \u00deetta getur teki\u00f0 allt a\u00f0 eina m\u00edn\u00fatu; t\u00e6ki\u00f0 ver\u00f0ur a\u00f0 vera tengt og \u00ed p\u00f6runarstillingu.", // EN: The device is being searched for on the same network and paired. This can take up to a minute; the device must be on and in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz bulunamad\u0131 ya da e\u015fle\u015ftirilemedi. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda, a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "T\u00e6ki\u00f0 fannst ekki e\u00f0a gat ekki veri\u00f0 para\u00f0. Gakktu \u00far skugga um a\u00f0 \u00fea\u00f0 s\u00e9 \u00e1 sama neti, kveikt \u00e1 \u00fev\u00ed og \u00fea\u00f0 s\u00e9 \u00ed p\u00f6runarstillingu.", // EN: The device was not found or could not be paired. Make sure it is on the same network, powered on and in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz bulunamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda, a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011fundan emin ol. Bilgisayar\u0131n g\u00fcvenlik duvar\u0131 yerel a\u011fdaki cihazlar\u0131n yan\u0131t\u0131n\u0131 engelliyor olabilir.": "T\u00e6ki\u00f0 fannst ekki. Gakktu \u00far skugga um a\u00f0 \u00fea\u00f0 s\u00e9 \u00e1 sama neti, kveikt \u00e1 \u00fev\u00ed og \u00fea\u00f0 s\u00e9 \u00ed p\u00f6runarstillingu. Eldveggur t\u00f6lvunnar \u00feinnar g\u00e6ti veri\u00f0 a\u00f0 loka fyrir sv\u00f6r fr\u00e1 t\u00e6kjum \u00e1 sta\u00f0arneti.", // EN: The device was not found. Make sure it is on the same network, powered on and in pairing mode. Your computer's firewall may be blocking replies from devices on the local network.
    "Cihaz e\u015fle\u015ftirilemedi. E\u015fle\u015ftirme kodunu ve cihaz\u0131n e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011funu kontrol et.": "Gat ekki veri\u00f0 para\u00f0 t\u00e6ki\u00f0. Athuga\u00f0u p\u00f6runark\u00f3\u00f0ann og a\u00f0 t\u00e6ki\u00f0 s\u00e9 \u00ed p\u00f6runarstillingu.", // EN: The device could not be paired. Check the pairing code and that the device is in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz e\u015fle\u015fti ama NEXUS'un kontrol edebilece\u011fi bir i\u015flevi yok.": "T\u00e6ki\u00f0 var para\u00f0 en hefur ekki virkni sem NEXUS getur stj\u00f3rna\u00f0.", // EN: The device paired but has no function NEXUS can control.
    "Cihaz yan\u0131t vermedi. A\u00e7\u0131k ve ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "T\u00e6ki\u00f0 svara\u00f0i ekki. Gakktu \u00far skugga um a\u00f0 \u00fea\u00f0 s\u00e9 kveikt og \u00e1 sama neti.", // EN: The device did not respond. Make sure it is on and on the same network.
