    "QR kodunu tarat\u0131n veya kurulum kodunu girin.": "Skanna\u00f0u QR k\u00f3\u00f0ann e\u00f0a sl\u00e1\u00f0u inn uppsetningark\u00f3\u00f0ann.", // EN: Scan the QR code or enter the setup code.
    "QR kodunu \u00e7er\u00e7evenin i\u00e7ine hizalay\u0131n.": "Stilla QR k\u00f3\u00f0ann innan rammans.", // EN: Align the QR code inside the frame.
    "QR okunamazsa, a\u015fa\u011f\u0131daki manuel ekleme se\u00e7ene\u011fiyle kodu elle girin.": "Ef QR k\u00f3\u00f0ann er ekki h\u00e6gt a\u00f0 lesa, sl\u00e1\u00f0u inn k\u00f3\u00f0ann handvirkt me\u00f0 handvirka valkostinum h\u00e9r a\u00f0 ne\u00f0an.", // EN: If the QR can't be read, enter the code manually with the manual option below.
    "QR tarama, kurulum kodu ve manuel katalog ile cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 ger\u00e7ek ak\u0131\u015f \u00fczerinden ekleyebilirsin.": "\u00de\u00fa getur b\u00e6tt vi\u00f0 t\u00e6kin \u00fe\u00edn me\u00f0 sj\u00e1lfvirkri skimun, QR k\u00f3\u00f0a, uppsetningark\u00f3\u00f0a e\u00f0a handvirku skr\u00e1asafni.", // EN: You can add your devices by automatic scan, QR code, setup code or the manual catalog.
