    "TV Ortam I\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131": "Umhverfisl\u00fdsing \u00e1 sj\u00f3nvarpi", // EN: TV Ambient Light
    "TV odas\u0131 i\u00e7in k\u0131s\u0131k parlakl\u0131kta sinema sahnesi olu\u015ftur.": "B\u00fa\u00f0u til daufa\u00f0 kvikmyndarherbergissenu fyrir sj\u00f3nvarpsherbergi\u00f0.", // EN: Create a dimmed cinema scene for the TV room.
    "TV ve medya cihazlar\u0131 i\u00e7in bir sinema modu uygulamas\u0131 olu\u015ftur. Film ba\u015flat, ses seviyesi, ortam \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 ve dikkat da\u011f\u0131tmayan gece e\u011flence k\u0131sayollar\u0131 olsun.": "B\u00fa\u00f0u til kvikmyndastillingarforrit fyrir sj\u00f3nv\u00f6rp og fj\u00f6lmi\u00f0lat\u00e6ki. Innihalda heppniskjara kvikmynda, hlj\u00f3\u00f0styrk, umhverfisl\u00fdsingu og truflunarfrj\u00e1lsa kv\u00f6ldskemmtun \u00ed fl\u00fdtilykla.", // EN: Create a cinema mode app for TVs and media devices. Include start movie, volume, ambient lights and distraction-free evening entertainment shortcuts.
    "TV ve medya cihazlar\u0131 i\u00e7in tek dokunu\u015flu e\u011flence paneli.": "Skemmtilegur spjaldi me\u00f0 einum smelli fyrir sj\u00f3nv\u00f6rp og fj\u00f6lmi\u00f0lat\u00e6ki.", // EN: One-tap entertainment panel for TVs and media devices.
    "TV, hoparl\u00f6r ve e\u011flence cihazlar\u0131": "Sj\u00f3nv\u00f6rp, h\u00e1talarar og skemmtitat\u00e6ki", // EN: TVs, speakers and entertainment devices
    "TV, medya kutusu ve ortam \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131 tek aksiyonda birle\u015ftir. Film ba\u015flat, gece modu ve dikkat da\u011f\u0131tmayan e\u011flence sahneleri kolayca kurulabilsin.": "Sameina\u00f0u sj\u00f3nvarp, fj\u00f6lmi\u00f0lakassa og umhverfisl\u00fdsingu \u00ed eina a\u00f0ger\u00f0. Ger\u00f0u \u00fea\u00f0 au\u00f0velt a\u00f0 stilla upphaf kvikmyndar, n\u00e6turstillingu og truflunarfrj\u00e1lsar skemmtisendur.", // EN: Combine the TV, media box and ambient lights in one action. Make it easy to set up start movie, night mode and distraction-free entertainment scenes.
    "Tabii ki! Senin i\u00e7in harika bir ak\u0131ll\u0131 senaryo kurgulayabilirim. Bana biraz detay verir misin? \u00d6rne\u011fin: \"Sabah uyand\u0131\u011f\u0131mda kahve makinesi \u00e7al\u0131\u015fs\u0131n\" veya \"Film izlerken \u0131\u015f\u0131klar tamamen k\u0131s\u0131ls\u0131n\" gibi bir istekte bulunabilirsin.": "Au\u00f0vita\u00f0! \u00c9g get sett saman fr\u00e1b\u00e6ra snjalla senuna fyrir \u00feig. G\u00e6tir\u00f0u gefi\u00f0 m\u00e9r nokkrar uppl\u00fdsingar? Til d\u00e6mis: \"Kveikja \u00e1 kaffiv\u00e9l \u00feegar \u00e9g vakna\" e\u00f0a \"Dj\u00fapl\u00e6gja lj\u00f3si\u00f0 alveg \u00feegar \u00e9g horfi \u00e1 kvikmynd\".", // EN: Of course! I can put together a great smart scenario for you. Could you give me a few details? For example: "Start the coffee machine when I wake up" or "Dim the lights fully when I watch a movie".
