    "Temizlik ba\u015flad\u0131\u011f\u0131nda NEXUS AI, yerdeki engelleri alg\u0131layacak ve ses seviyesini odadaki doluluk durumuna g\u00f6re otomatik ayarlayacakt\u0131r.": "\u00deegar \u00ferif hefjast greinir NEXUS AI hindranir \u00e1 g\u00f3lfinu og stillir hlj\u00f3\u00f0styrk sj\u00e1lfkrafa eftir \u00fev\u00ed hversu margir eru \u00ed herberginu.", // EN: When cleaning starts, NEXUS AI detects obstacles on the floor and adjusts the volume automatically based on room occupancy.
    "Temizlik cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 uygun s\u0131ra ve modla ba\u015flat\u0131r.": "Hefur \u00ferifat\u00e6ki \u00ed r\u00e9ttri r\u00f6\u00f0 og stillingu.", // EN: Starts cleaning devices in the right order and mode.
    "Temizlik cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 ve destekleyici ev ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r.": "Keyrir \u00ferifat\u00e6ki og sty\u00f0jandi heimilstillingar.", // EN: Run cleaning devices and supporting home settings.
