    "T\u00fcm cihazlar\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 tek bir merkezden, sesinizle veya otomatik senaryolarla y\u00f6netin.": "Stj\u00f3rna\u00f0u \u00f6llum t\u00e6kjum \u00fe\u00ednum fr\u00e1 einum sta\u00f0, me\u00f0 r\u00f6dd \u00feinni e\u00f0a me\u00f0 sj\u00e1lfvirkum atbur\u00f0ar\u00e1sum.", // EN: Manage all your devices from one place, with your voice or with automatic scenarios.
