    "Uyan\u0131nca \u0131\u015f\u0131k, perde, iklim ve m\u00fczi\u011fi tek dokunu\u015fla ba\u015flat.": "Kveiktu \u00e1 lj\u00f3sum, gluggatj\u00f6ldum, loftslagi og t\u00f3nlist me\u00f0 einum smelli \u00feegar \u00fe\u00fa vaknar.", // EN: Start lights, blinds, climate and music with one tap when you wake up.
    "Kap\u0131dan girerken \u0131\u015f\u0131klar, iklim ve m\u00fczik seni kar\u015f\u0131las\u0131n.": "Lj\u00f3s, loftslag og t\u00f3nlist bj\u00f3\u00f0a \u00fe\u00e9r velkomin \u00feegar \u00fe\u00fa gengur inn.", // EN: Lights, climate and music greet you as you walk in.
    "Ev bo\u015fken tasarruf, taklit hareket ve uyar\u0131 tek panelde.": "Sparna\u00f0ur, hermt n\u00e6rvera og vi\u00f0varanir \u00e1 einu m\u00e6labor\u00f0i me\u00f0an heimili\u00f0 er t\u00f3mt.", // EN: Savings, simulated presence and alerts in one panel while the home is empty.
    "Robot s\u00fcp\u00fcrge ve temizlik cihazlar\u0131 i\u00e7in g\u00fcn ve oda plan\u0131.": "Dag- og herbergis\u00e1\u00e6tlanir fyrir ryksugu- og hreinger\u00f0art\u00e6ki.", // EN: Day and room plans for robot vacuums and cleaning devices.
    "Sulama saatleri, b\u00f6lgeler ve sens\u00f6r verisiyle ak\u0131ll\u0131 plan.": "Snjallv\u00f6kvunar \u00e1\u00e6tlanir, sv\u00e6\u00f0i og skynjara-drifin \u00e1\u00e6tlun.", // EN: Smart watering schedules, zones and sensor-driven planning.
    "Sens\u00f6r verisiyle havaland\u0131rma ve temizleyiciyi otomatik y\u00f6net.": "Stj\u00f3rna\u00f0u loftr\u00e6stingu og lofthreinsurum sj\u00e1lfkrafa \u00fat fr\u00e1 skynjara-g\u00f6gnum.", // EN: Manage ventilation and purifiers automatically from sensor data.
