    "Yatak odas\u0131": "Svefnherbergi", // EN: Bedroom
    "Yatmadan \u00f6nce gerekli t\u00fcm ev kontrollerini tek merkezde topla. I\u015f\u0131k azaltma, rahats\u0131z etme, kilit kontrol\u00fc ve gece iklim ayarlar\u0131 tek ekranda y\u00f6netilsin.": "Safna\u00f0u \u00f6llum athugunum \u00e1 heimili\u00f0 sem \u00fe\u00fa \u00fearft \u00e1\u00f0ur en \u00fe\u00fa fer\u00f0 a\u00f0 sofa \u00e1 einum sta\u00f0. Dimmu lj\u00f3sin, ekki trufla, l\u00e1sasko\u00f0un og n\u00e6turstillingar loftslag \u00e1 einum skj\u00e1.", // EN: Gather all the home checks you need before bed in one center. Dim lights, do not disturb, lock check and night climate settings on one screen.
    "Yatmadan \u00f6nce \u0131\u015f\u0131k, sessiz mod, kilit ve iklim ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 y\u00f6neten bir uykuya haz\u0131rl\u0131k merkezi olu\u015ftur. Son kontrol \u00f6zeti ve tek dokunu\u015f gece modu ekle.": "B\u00fa\u00f0u til svefnb\u00fana\u00f0armi\u00f0st\u00f6\u00f0 sem st\u00fdrir lj\u00f3sum, \u00fe\u00f6gnarham, l\u00e1sum og loftslagi fyrir h\u00e1ttinn. B\u00e6ttu vi\u00f0 lokasko\u00f0unarsk\u00fdrslu og einni snertingu \u00ed n\u00e6turham.", // EN: Create a bedtime preparation center that manages lights, quiet mode, locks and climate before bed. Add a final check summary and one-tap night mode.
