    "\u00d6nce bir senaryo se\u00e7.": "Veldu svi\u00f0 fyrst.", // EN: Choose a scene first.
    "Kaydetmek i\u00e7in \u00f6nce ev konumunu se\u00e7.": "Veldu heimilissta\u00f0 \u00feinn fyrst til a\u00f0 vista.", // EN: Choose your home location first to save.
    "Cihaz Se\u00e7": "Veldu t\u00e6ki", // EN: Choose Devices
    "Bu ekran\u0131 iPhone'daki NEXUS uygulamas\u0131nda a\u00e7; senaryolar\u0131n a\u015fa\u011f\u0131da listelenir ve her biri i\u00e7in Siri kestirmesi kurabilirsin.": "Opna\u00f0u \u00feetta skj\u00e1bor\u00f0 \u00ed NEXUS-appinu \u00e1 iPhone \u00fe\u00ednum; svi\u00f0in \u00fe\u00edn eru skr\u00e1\u00f0 h\u00e9r a\u00f0 ne\u00f0an og \u00fe\u00fa getur sett upp Siri fl\u00fdtilei\u00f0 fyrir hvert \u00feeirra.", // EN: Open this screen in the NEXUS app on your iPhone; your scenes are listed below and you can set up a Siri shortcut for each one.
    "1. Senaryo ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 kopyala": "1. Afrita\u00f0u hlekkinn \u00e1 svi\u00f0i\u00f0", // EN: 1. Copy the scene link
    "Bu ba\u011flant\u0131 NEXUS'u a\u00e7ar ve senaryoyu hemen \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131r.": "\u00deessi hlekkur opnar NEXUS og keyrir svi\u00f0i\u00f0 strax.", // EN: This link opens NEXUS and runs the scene right away.
    "2. Kestirmeler'de yeni kestirme olu\u015ftur": "2. B\u00fa\u00f0u til n\u00fdja fl\u00fdtilei\u00f0 \u00ed Fl\u00fdtilei\u00f0um", // EN: 2. Create a new shortcut in Shortcuts
    "\"Eylem Ekle\" \u203a \"URL'leri A\u00e7\" eylemini se\u00e7 ve kopyalad\u0131\u011f\u0131n ba\u011flant\u0131y\u0131 yap\u0131\u015ft\u0131r.": "Veldu \"B\u00e6ta vi\u00f0 a\u00f0ger\u00f0\" \u203a \"Opna vefsl\u00f3\u00f0ir\" og l\u00edmdu inn hlekkinn sem \u00fe\u00fa afrita\u00f0ir.", // EN: Choose "Add Action" › "Open URLs" and paste the link you copied.
    "Kestirmeler uygulamas\u0131n\u0131 a\u00e7": "Opna\u00f0u appi\u00f0 Fl\u00fdtilei\u00f0ir", // EN: Open the Shortcuts app
    "Cihazlar\u0131na uyan haz\u0131r otomasyonlardan birini tek dokunu\u015fla ekle.": "B\u00e6ttu vi\u00f0 tilb\u00fanu sj\u00e1lfvirkni sem hentar t\u00e6kjunum \u00fe\u00ednum me\u00f0 einum smelli.", // EN: Add a ready-made automation that fits your devices with one tap.
    "Belirli bir saatte; her g\u00fcn, hafta i\u00e7i ya da hafta sonu": "\u00c1 \u00e1kve\u00f0num t\u00edma; daglega, virka daga e\u00f0a um helgar", // EN: At a set time; every day, on weekdays or at weekends
    "G\u00fcn Do\u011fumu / Bat\u0131m\u0131": "S\u00f3laruppr\u00e1s / S\u00f3larlag", // EN: Sunrise / Sunset
    "Ev konumuna g\u00f6re g\u00fcne\u015f do\u011farken ya da batarken": "Vi\u00f0 s\u00f3laruppr\u00e1s e\u00f0a s\u00f3larlag fyrir heimilissta\u00f0 \u00feinn", // EN: At sunrise or sunset for your home location
    "Cihaz ve Sens\u00f6r": "T\u00e6ki & Skynjarar", // EN: Devices & Sensors
    "Hareket Alg\u0131land\u0131\u011f\u0131nda": "\u00deegar hreyfing er skynju\u00f0", // EN: When Motion Is Detected
    "Hareket sens\u00f6r\u00fc bir hareket alg\u0131lad\u0131\u011f\u0131nda": "\u00deegar hreyfiskynjari skynjar hreyfingu", // EN: When a motion sensor detects movement
    "Kap\u0131 veya Pencere A\u00e7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda": "\u00deegar hur\u00f0 e\u00f0a gluggi opnast", // EN: When a Door or Window Opens
    "Kap\u0131/pencere sens\u00f6r\u00fc a\u00e7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda": "\u00deegar hur\u00f0-/gluggaskynjari opnast", // EN: When a door/window sensor opens
    "Duman, su bask\u0131n\u0131 ya da gaz sens\u00f6r\u00fc uyard\u0131\u011f\u0131nda": "\u00deegar reykskynjari, fl\u00f3\u00f0skynjari e\u00f0a gasskynjari hlj\u00f3mar vi\u00f0v\u00f6run", // EN: When a smoke, flood or gas sensor raises an alarm
    "Cihaz ve sens\u00f6r tetikleyicileri, uygun bir cihaz ekleyince burada g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr.": "R\u00e1sir t\u00e6kja og skynjara birtast h\u00e9r \u00feegar \u00fe\u00fa b\u00e6tir vi\u00f0 vi\u00f0eigandi t\u00e6ki.", // EN: Device and sensor triggers appear here once you add a suitable device.
    "Ev ve \u00c7evre": "Heimili & Umhverfi", // EN: Home & Surroundings
    "S\u0131cakl\u0131k, r\u00fczg\u00e2r ya da ya\u011f\u0131\u015f bir e\u015fi\u011fi ge\u00e7ti\u011finde": "\u00deegar hitastig, vindur e\u00f0a rigning fer yfir vi\u00f0mi\u00f0", // EN: When temperature, wind or rain passes a threshold
