    "Ak\u015fam yeme\u011fi": "Kv\u00f6ldmatur", // EN: Dinner
    "Perdeleri a\u00e7": "Opna gard\u00ednur", // EN: Open the curtains
    "Kap\u0131lar\u0131 kilitle": "L\u00e6sa hur\u00f0um", // EN: Lock the doors
    "B\u00fct\u00fcn \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 tam parlakl\u0131kta a\u00e7ar.": "Kveikir \u00e1 \u00f6llum lj\u00f3sum a\u00f0 fullu birtustigi.", // EN: Turns on every light at full brightness.
    "B\u00fct\u00fcn \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 kapat\u0131r.": "Sl\u00f6kkvir \u00e1 \u00f6llum lj\u00f3sum.", // EN: Turns off every light.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 tam parlakl\u0131kta, g\u00fcn \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 tonunda a\u00e7ar.": "Kveikir lj\u00f3s a\u00f0 fullu \u00ed dagsbirtingsl\u00fdsingu.", // EN: Turns lights on at full brightness in a daylight tone.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 %85 n\u00f6tr tona getirir, TV'yi kapat\u0131r.": "Stillir lj\u00f3s \u00e1 85% \u00ed hlutlausu t\u00f3ni og sl\u00f6kir \u00e1 sj\u00f3nvarpinu.", // EN: Sets lights to 85% in a neutral tone and turns off the TV.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 %40 s\u0131cak tona getirir.": "Stillir lj\u00f3s \u00e1 40% \u00ed hl\u00fdjum t\u00f3ni.", // EN: Sets lights to 40% in a warm tone.
    "Her ak\u015fam 19:30": "\u00c1 hverju kv\u00f6ldi kl. 19:30", // EN: Every evening 19:30
    "Klimay\u0131 a\u00e7\u0131p 20\u00b0'ye, termostat\u0131 20\u00b0'ye ayarlar.": "Kveikir \u00e1 loftk\u00e6lingunni \u00e1 20\u00b0 og stillir hitastigi\u00f0 \u00e1 20\u00b0.", // EN: Turns the AC on at 20° and sets the thermostat to 20°.
    "Termostat\u0131 24\u00b0 konfor ayar\u0131na getirir.": "Stillir hitastigi\u00f0 \u00e1 24\u00b0 \u00fe\u00e6gindastillingu.", // EN: Sets the thermostat to a 24° comfort setting.
    "Hafta i\u00e7i 06:30": "Virka daga kl. 06:30", // EN: Weekdays 06:30
    "B\u00fct\u00fcn perde ve panjurlar\u0131 a\u00e7ar.": "Opnar alla gard\u00edna og blindu.", // EN: Opens every curtain and blind.
    "Her g\u00fcn g\u00fcn do\u011fumunda": "\u00c1 hverjum degi vi\u00f0 s\u00f3laruppr\u00e1s", // EN: Every day at sunrise
    "B\u00fct\u00fcn perde ve panjurlar\u0131 kapat\u0131r.": "Lokar \u00f6llum gard\u00ednum og blindum.", // EN: Closes every curtain and blind.
    "Her g\u00fcn g\u00fcn bat\u0131m\u0131nda": "\u00c1 hverjum degi vi\u00f0 s\u00f3lsetur", // EN: Every day at sunset
    "B\u00fct\u00fcn ak\u0131ll\u0131 kilitleri kilitler (kilit hi\u00e7bir zaman a\u00e7\u0131lmaz).": "L\u00e6sir \u00f6llum snjall\u00e1sum (l\u00e1sa er aldrei opna\u00f0).", // EN: Locks every smart lock (locks are never unlocked).
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 ve TV'yi kapat\u0131r; prizlere ve klimaya dokunmaz.": "Sl\u00f6kkt \u00e1 lj\u00f3sum og sj\u00f3nvarpi; l\u00e1ti\u00f0 stikk og loftk\u00e6linguna \u00f3snerta.", // EN: Turns off lights and the TV; leaves plugs and the AC alone.
    "Bir cihaz\u0131 a\u00e7 ya da kapat": "Kveikja \u00e1 t\u00e6ki e\u00f0a sl\u00f6kkva \u00e1 \u00fev\u00ed", // EN: Turn a device on or off
    "Se\u00e7ti\u011fin tek cihaza komut g\u00f6nderir.": "Sendir skipun til \u00feess t\u00e6kis sem \u00fe\u00fa velur.", // EN: Sends a command to the one device you pick.
    "Hangi cihaz?": "Hva\u00f0a t\u00e6ki?", // EN: Which device?
    "A\u00e7\u0131ls\u0131n": "Kveikja \u00e1", // EN: Turn on
    "Kapans\u0131n": "Sl\u00f6kkva \u00e1", // EN: Turn off
    "Kontrol edilecek cihaz\u0131 se\u00e7.": "Veldu t\u00e6ki\u00f0 til a\u00f0 stj\u00f3rna.", // EN: Choose the device to control.
    "Sens\u00f6rlerinin \u00f6l\u00e7t\u00fc\u011f\u00fc hava kalitesini, s\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve nemi g\u00f6r; ar\u0131t\u0131c\u0131n\u0131 y\u00f6net.": "Sj\u00e1 loftg\u00e6\u00f0i, hitastig og rakastig sem skynjarar \u00fe\u00ednir m\u00e6la, og stj\u00f3rna lofthreinsaranum.", // EN: See the air quality, temperature and humidity your sensors measure, and control your purifier.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131, perdeleri ve klimay\u0131 g\u00fcne ba\u015flarken tek dokunu\u015fla haz\u0131rla.": "Undirb\u00fa\u00f0u lj\u00f3s, gard\u00ednur og loftk\u00e6lingu fyrir daginn me\u00f0 einum smelli.", // EN: Get lights, curtains and the AC ready for the day with one tap.
    "Eve girerken \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131, perdeleri ve iklimi birlikte a\u00e7.": "Kveikja \u00e1 lj\u00f3sum, gard\u00ednum og loftslagi saman \u00feegar \u00fe\u00fa kemur heim.", // EN: Turn on lights, curtains and climate together when you get home.
    "Uzun s\u00fcre evde yokken cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 g\u00fcvenli ve tasarruflu konuma al.": "Settu t\u00e6kin \u00fe\u00edn \u00ed \u00f6ruggt, orkugjafasparandi \u00e1stand me\u00f0an \u00fe\u00fa ert \u00ed burtu um lengri t\u00edma.", // EN: Put your devices into a safe, energy-saving state while you are away for long.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 k\u0131s, perdeleri kapat ve TV'yi a\u00e7.": "Dimma\u00f0u lj\u00f3sin, loka\u00f0u gluggatj\u00f6ldunum og kveiktu \u00e1 sj\u00f3nvarpinu.", // EN: Dim the lights, close the curtains and turn on the TV.
    "Robot s\u00fcp\u00fcrgeni ba\u015flat ya da \u015farj istasyonuna g\u00f6nder.": "R\u00e6stu ryksuguv\u00e9lmenni\u00f0 e\u00f0a sendu \u00fea\u00f0 aftur \u00ed hle\u00f0slust\u00f6\u00f0ina.", // EN: Start your robot vacuum or send it back to its dock.
    "Kap\u0131y\u0131 kilitle, perdeleri kapat ve evi geceye haz\u0131rla.": "L\u00e6stu hur\u00f0inni, loka\u00f0u gluggatj\u00f6ldunum og undirb\u00fa\u00f0u h\u00fasi\u00f0 fyrir n\u00f3ttina.", // EN: Lock the door, close the curtains and get the house ready for the night.
    "Ekledi\u011fin kameralar\u0131n durumunu ve gizlilik ayar\u0131n\u0131 tek ekranda g\u00f6r.": "Sj\u00e1\u00f0u st\u00f6\u00f0u og pers\u00f3nuverndarsni\u00f0myndir myndav\u00e9la \u00feinna \u00e1 einum skj\u00e1.", // EN: See the status and privacy setting of your cameras on one screen.
    "Evdeyken kameralar\u0131n i\u00e7in gizlilik modunu tek yerden a\u00e7 ya da kapat.": "Kveiktu e\u00f0a sl\u00f6kktu \u00e1 pers\u00f3nuverndarstillingu fyrir myndav\u00e9lar \u00fe\u00ednar \u00e1 einum sta\u00f0 \u00feegar \u00fe\u00fa ert heima.", // EN: Turn privacy mode for your cameras on or off from one place while you are home.
    "Bug\u00fcn hangi otomasyonun ne zaman \u00e7al\u0131\u015faca\u011f\u0131n\u0131 g\u00f6r.": "Sj\u00e1 hva\u00f0a sj\u00e1lfvirkni fer af sta\u00f0 \u00ed dag.", // EN: See which automation runs when today.
    "Ev halk\u0131yla notlar\u0131 ve yap\u0131lacaklar\u0131 payla\u015f.": "Deildu athugasemdum og verkum me\u00f0 heimilisf\u00f3lki \u00fe\u00ednu.", // EN: Share notes and to-dos with your household.
    "Sens\u00f6rlerinin \u00f6l\u00e7t\u00fc\u011f\u00fc hava, nem ve s\u0131cakl\u0131ktan evinin sa\u011fl\u0131k \u00f6zetini g\u00f6r.": "Sj\u00e1\u00f0u heilsufarsyfirlit heimilisins \u00fat fr\u00e1 lofti, raki og hitastigi sem nemar \u00fe\u00ednir m\u00e6la.", // EN: See your home's health summary from the air, humidity and temperature your sensors measure.
    "Ekledi\u011fin cihazlar\u0131n yerel a\u011fdan ula\u015f\u0131labilir olup olmad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 kontrol et.": "Athuga\u00f0u hvort t\u00e6kin \u00fe\u00edn s\u00e9u a\u00f0gengileg yfir sta\u00f0bundna neti\u00f0 \u00feitt.", // EN: Check whether your devices can be reached over your local network.
