    "I set up the \"{0}\" automation: it runs {1} and adjusts {2} devices. Automations run while the app is open (also from the tray on desktop).": "\u00c9g stofna\u00f0i \"{0}\" sj\u00e1lfvirkni: h\u00fan keyrir {1} og stillir {2} t\u00e6ki. Sj\u00e1lfvirkni keyra me\u00f0an forriti\u00f0 er opi\u00f0 (einnig \u00far kerfisleit \u00e1 t\u00f6lvu).", // EN: I set up the "{0}" automation: it runs {1} and adjusts {2} devices. Automations run while the app is open (also from the tray on desktop).
    "I set up the \"{0}\" automation: it runs {1} and adjusts {2} device. Automations run while the app is open (also from the tray on desktop).": "\u00c9g setti upp \u201e{0}\u201c sj\u00e1lfvirknina: h\u00fan keyrir {1} og stillir {2} t\u00e6ki\u00f0. Sj\u00e1lfvirkni keyrir me\u00f0an forriti\u00f0 er opi\u00f0 (einnig \u00far kerfist\u00e1 \u00e1 skj\u00e1bor\u00f0i).", // EN: I set up the "{0}" automation: it runs {1} and adjusts {2} device. Automations run while the app is open (also from the tray on desktop).
