    "That does not look like a device command. Try: \"turn off the living room light\" or \"set the AC to 22\".": "\u00deetta l\u00edtur ekki \u00fat eins og t\u00e6ki\u00f0 sem skipun. Reyndu: \u201esl\u00f6kktu \u00e1 stofulj\u00f3sinu\u201c e\u00f0a \u201estillingu loftk\u00e6lingar \u00ed 22\u201c.", // EN: That does not look like a device command. Try: "turn off the living room light" or "set the AC to 22".
